002,36,93,31],[21065,13.6,2002,38,98,30],[21066,12.4,2002,40,98,29],[21067,13.9,2002,47,91,23]],"links":[["Washington County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/utah/washington-county"],["ARC or PLC in Washington County","/arc-plc/utah/washington-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 17 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 43 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 30% of normal in January to February and 187% in May to June. So far in 2026 the middle sits at 29% of normal for May to June and 120% for June to July. Grid 20464 had its driest year in 2002 at 29% of normal.</p>"}
